<title>USA: Prudential wins Metro Atlanta Rapid $165 mln.</title>
<headline>Prudential wins Metro Atlanta Rapid $165 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities said it won $165 million of Metropolitan Atlanta Rapid Transit Authority, Ga., sales tax revenue bonds, second indenture series, refunding series 1996A, with a net interest cost (NIC) of 5.59 percent percent.</p>
</text>
